 234  *==============================================================================
 235  *  Periods
 236  *==============================================================================
 237  * The set TIME is the period of time for which we have projections for GDP,
 238  * population and economically active population .
 239  TIME Time periods
 240  /
 241  2019*2050
 242  *2019
 243   
 244  /
 245  T(time)
 246  T1(time)         First period;
 247  T1(time)         = yes$[ord(time) eq 1];
