 407  *==============================================================================
 408  *   2.2.2 Price variables
 409  *==============================================================================
 410   eO(z)           Exchange rate (price of international currency in terms of region z local currency)
 411   IRO(z)          Interest rate
 412   PO(i,z)         Basic price of commodity i in region z
