 479   TPRCTSO(z)      Total government revenue from taxes on products and imports in region z
 480   TPRODNO(z)      Total government revenue from other taxes on production in region z
 481   YDHO(z)         Household disposable income in region z
 482   YGO(z)          Total government income in region z
 483   YHO(z)          Household total income in region z
