2812   EQ17(z,time)            Total government receipts of taxes on production
2813   EQ18(z,time)            Government receipts of indirect taxes on wages
2814   EQ19(z,time)            Government receipts of indirect taxes on capital
2815   EQ20(z,time)            Government receipts of indirect taxes on production
2816   EQ21(z,time)            Total government receipts of taxes on products and imports
2817   EQ22(z,time)            Government receipts of indirect taxes on consumption
2818   EQ23(z,time)            Government receipts of indirect taxes on imports
2819   EQ24(z,time)            Government receipts of indirect taxes on exports
2820   EQ25(z,time)            Household h income taxes
2821   EQ26(l,j,z,time)        Government receipts of indirect taxes on wages
2822   EQ27(k,j,z,time)        Government receipts of indirect taxes on capital
2823   EQ28(j,z,time)          Government receipts of indirect taxes on production of industry j
2824   EQ29(i,z,time)          Government receipts of indirect taxes on commodity i
2825   EQ30(i,zj,z,time)       Government receipts of indirect taxes on imports of commodity i
2826   EQ31(i,z,zj,time)       Government receipts of indirect taxes on exports of commodity i
2827   EQ32(z,time)            Government savings
2828   EQ33(z,time)            Rest of the world total income
2829   EQ34(z,time)            Rest of the world savings
2830   EQ35(z,time)            Equivalence between current account balance and savings
2831   EQ36(i,z,time)          Household consumption of commodity i
2832   EQ37(i,z,time)          Final demand of commodity i for investment purposes
2833   EQ38(i,z,time)          Public final consumption of commodity i
2834   CALEQ2(z,time)          Current government expenditures on goods and services
2835   EQ39(i,z,time)          Total intermediate consumption of commodity i
2836   EQ39_1(i,z,time)        Total intermediate consumption of commodity i
2837  * EQ40_1(j,z)             CET between different commodities produced by industry j
2838  * EQ40_2(j,i,z)           Industry j production of commodity i (CET)
2839   EQ40_3(i,z,time)        Domestic supply by commdities
2840   EQ40_4(j,z,time)        Total supply by commdities
2841   EQ40_5(i,z,time)        CET function between exports local production and margins
2842   EQ41(i,z,time)          Supply of composite exports
2843   EQ42(i,z,time)          Supply of margins
2844   EQ43(i,z,time)          CET function between exports by trading partner
2845   EQ44(i,z,zj,time)       Supply of exports by trading partner
2846   EQ45(i,z,time)          CES function between composite imports and local production
2847   EQ46(i,z,time)          Demand for composite imports
2848   EQ47(i,z,time)          CES function between imports by origin
2849   EQ48(i,zj,z,time)       Demand for imports by origin
2850   EQ49(j,z,time)          Producer price in energy industries j after production taxes
2851   EQ49_1(j,z,time)        Producer price in industry j after production taxes
2852  * EQ49_2(j,i,z)     Total producer price is equal to P if there is only one product
2853  * EQ49_3(j,i,z)     Basic price of industry j's production of commodity i
2854   EQ50(j,z,time)          Basic price of industry j production
2855   EQ51(j,z,time)          Price index of industry j intermediate consumption
2856   EQ51_1(j,z,time)        Price index of industry j intermediate energy consumption
2857   EQ52(j,z,time)          Value added price
2858   EQ52_1(j,z,time)        KLE price
2859  * EQ53(j,z)         Price of composite labor in industry j (redundant)
2860   EQ54(l,j,z,time)        Wages including taxes
2861   EQ54_1(ene,j,z,time)    energy commodity prices
2862  * EQ55(j,z)         Price of composite capital in industry j (redundant)
2863   EQ56(k,j,z,time)        Rental rate including taxes
2864  * EQ57(k,j,z,time)        Rate of remuneration of capital k (capital mobile)
2865   EQ58(i,z,time)          Producer price is a weighted sum of PE and PL
2866  * EQ59(i,z)         Price of composite export i (redundant)
2867   EQ60(i,z,zj,time)       Border price of exported commodity i
2868   EQ61(i,z,time)          Price of local product i (including all taxes and margins)
2869   EQ62(i,zj,z,time)       Price of imported commodity i (including all taxes and duties)
2870  * EQ63(i,z)         Price of composite import i (redundant)
