2872  * EQ65(z,time)            Aggregate price of capital
2873   EQ66(z,time)            GDP deflator (Fischer index)
2874   EQ67(time)              World GDP deflator (Fischer index)
2875   EQ68(z,time)            Consumer price index (Laspeyres)
2876   EQ69(z,time)            Investment price index (derived from investment function)
2877   EQ70(z,time)            Public expenditure price index
2878   EQ71(i1,z,time)         Domestic absorbtion
