2880   EQ73(k,z,time)          Capital supply equals capital demand
2881   EQ74(z,time)            Total investment equals total savings
2882   EQ75(z,time)            Depreciation
2883   EQ76(i,z,time)          Supply of domestic production equals demand
2884   EQ77(i,z,zj,time)       Exports supply equals imports demand
2885   EQ78(i,z,zj,time)       Exports price equals imports price
