2897   EQ90(z,time)            Real GDP at market prices
2898   EQ91(z,time)            Real gross fixed capital formation
2899   EQ92(z,time)            Current account balance of region z in terms of the reference currency
2900   EQ93                    fictitious OBJ. fuction
2901   WALRAS(z,time)          Walras law verification
2902  * EQB_1(i,z)        Top Nest - CES function Aggregated acitivty
2903  * EQB_2(j,i,z)      Top Nest - CES function Aggregated acitivty
2904  * EQB_3(j,i,z)      Total producer price is equal to P if there is only one product
2905  * EQB_4(j,i,z)      Basic price of industry j's production of commodity i
2906  * EQB_5(j,i,z)      Supply of exports for compsite activity
2907   EQA_1(z,time)           Top Nest - Leontief function Aggregated-Electricity
2908   EQA_2(Z,time)           Top Nest - Leontief function Aggregated-Electricity
2909   EQA_3(z,time)           Second Nest - CES function - Aggregated-Electricity
2910   EQA_4(power,i,z,time)   Second Nest - CES function - Aggregated-Electricity
2911   EQB_1(i2,z,time)        Industry j production of commodity i (CES)
2912   EQB_3(j,i,z,time)       Total producer price is equal to P if there is only one product
2913   EQB_4(j,i,z,time)       Basic price of industry js production of commodity i
2914   EQB_5(j,i,z,time)       Supply of exports for compsite activity
2915   
2916   EQ94(z,time)            Total investment expenditure constraint
2917   EQ95(z,time)            Aggregate price of capital
2918   EQ96(k,bus,z,time)      Investment demand by industry
2919   CALEQ3(k,pub,z,time)    Public investment demand
